WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The tour is €60. Your group has three adults.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Does €60 mean per person or in total?

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Is that €60 per person or €60 in total?

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It is €60 per person.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
So that is €180 in total for three people, right?

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
€45 each becomes €90 in total for two people.
